  "source": {
    "design": "Hallmark theme Midnight (ADR 0052): midnight-blue ground to every edge, cool white ink, Mona Sans expanded at 300 for heads, square surfaces in lightness steps, one azure signal. Converted from the theme's OKLCH values to hex so Compose and CSS share them.",
